1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,200
Autonomous AI agents promise to run our workflows, but in production, they face a fatal flaw:

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:10,500
black-box execution, unpredictable hallucinations, and zero safety controls when performing destructive actions.

3
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:16,200
If an agent deletes a cloud database or deploys broken code, there is no rewind button.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Enterprises cannot deploy autonomous intelligence without absolute control.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,500
Meet ORCHESTRA. Built for the Amazon Alexa+ Track,

6
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:31,000
ORCHESTRA is an agentic mission-execution platform that brings deterministic finite-state control,

7
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:36,200
human-in-the-loop governance, and verifiable auditability to autonomous tool execution.

8
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:41,800
Instead of blind delegation, ORCHESTRA compiles intent into a validated Directed Acyclic Graph,

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,500
executing tools securely through the Model Context Protocol.

10
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Let's create a mission: deploying a production release and notifying stakeholders.

11
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:58,800
In real-time, the ORCHESTRA planner evaluates dependencies and compiles an execution graph across eight formal states.

12
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,500
Every step is cryptographically bound, and low-risk steps like artifact validation and security linting

13
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:10,200
execute automatically via Streamable HTTP MCP tools.

14
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:17,500
All state transitions are deterministic, preventing race conditions and runaway loops.

15
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,500
Here's the critical breakthrough: when ORCHESTRA reaches a destructive step, it halts.

16
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:28,200
The state machine transitions automatically to Approval Required.

17
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:34,000
The human operator reviews the exact action payload, parameters, and risk score.

18
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:39,800
We approve the step, execution seamlessly resumes, and our verification engine

19
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,000
validates the output state using SHA-256 state fingerprinting before marking it complete.

20
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:51,500
No unapproved changes ever reach production environments.

21
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:56,800
Under the hood, ORCHESTRA is powered by the Model Context Protocol.

22
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:02,500
By exposing tools over Streamable HTTP and Server-Sent Events, Alexa+ agents and LLMs

23
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:07,800
can dynamically discover capabilities and stream payloads with sub-second latency.

24
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:13,200
OAuth credentials and tokens are secured using military-grade AES-256-GCM encryption.

25
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:19,500
100% of our core monorepo packages are fully verified with 67 passing automated tests.

26
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:25,500
ORCHESTRA transforms AI agents from risky toys into enterprise-ready operators.

27
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:31,200
With deterministic state machines, MCP standard interoperability, and human verification,

28
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:36,000
it represents the future of safe agentic workflows.

29
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:41,200
Check out our open-source codebase on GitHub and test the live platform on Render today.

30
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:45,000
Thank you!
